# The published plugin archive contains the source that apps compile: android/, ios/, macos/,
# linux/, windows/, cargokit/, rust/src, Cargo.toml, and Cargo.lock.
# The archive does not contain build output or files that are specific to one machine.
# Before publication, tool/sync_native.sh copies the crate into rust/.
# The source of the crate is packages/iroh_quic/rust.
#
# NOTE: For publication, a .pubignore file replaces the .gitignore file of this directory.
# Thus, this file must list all exclusions.
rust/target/
**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/Pods/
**/.symlinks/
**/ephemeral/
**/Podfile.lock
**/xcuserdata/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
example/
